  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GHM Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grands Hotels de Mauritanie SA (GHM), is a special purpose vehicle (SPV) set up for the development of a 200-key Edge-certified upper upscale business hotel in Nouakchott, Mauritania to be operated by Marriott International under the Sheraton brand (the Project)</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Projet is expected to have positive Project-level outcomes through improved access to business infrastructure and suppliers through supply chain development. Beyond the Project, IFC anticipates that the investment will promote greater competitiveness in the tourism sector in Mauritania through improved availability and quality of product and service offerings in the market.</narrative>
  </description>
